# specd's bytes are LF on every platform. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf
# left on its default rewrites the tree to CRLF, which makes gofmt report every
# Go file as unformatted and every golden comparison drift by one byte per line.
# The line ending is part of the source, so it is pinned here rather than left
# to a contributor's Git configuration.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are compared byte for byte. They get no end-of-line translation at
# all, in either direction.
*.golden -text
